7	/*
8	 * This driver implements a version of the RISC-V PLIC with the actual layout
9	 * specified in chapter 8 of the SiFive U5 Coreplex Series Manual:
10	 *
11	 *     https://static.dev.sifive.com/U54-MC-RVCoreIP.pdf
12	 *
13	 * The largest number supported by devices marked as 'sifive,plic-1.0.0', is
14	 * 1024, of which device 0 is defined as non-existent by the RISC-V Privileged
15	 * Spec.
16	 */
